OL,3,GNEWSAHospital teams collaborate on
OL,4,Acoeliac disease study
OL,5,
OL,6,FA district hospital has undertaken an
OL,7,F"unusual study of its kind" to find out
OL,8,Fif there is a link between bone
OL,9,Ffractures and coeliac disease.
OL,11,FKettering General Hospital in
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire tested 1,200 patients
OL,13,Ffrom June 2023 to August 2025 in a
OL,14,Fcollaboration between its fracture
OL,15,Fclinic, gastroenterology department and
OL,16,Fresearchers.
OL,18,FCoeliac disease is a medical condition
OL,19,Fwhere the body has an inflammatory
OL,20,Freaction to gluten, but it can also
OL,21,Faffect bone health, it added.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
